stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NoDecision
  NoDecision --> Authorized: approve once
  NoDecision --> Declined: decline once
  Authorized --> Captured: one full capture / same amount + currency
  Authorized --> Voided: void before capture
  Captured --> Captured: bounded positive partial refund
  Captured --> Refunded: cumulative refunds equal capture
  Voided --> [*]
  Declined --> [*]
  Refunded --> [*]
